      "name": "NYHA presser @ Hochul office",
      "date": "2026-10-17T10:00:00Z",
      "date_formatted": "10:00 AM, Saturday October 17, 2026",
      "month_year": "2026-10",
      "month_label": "October 2026",
      "status": "confirmed",
      "description": "<div><div>DSA will condemn the worst of the for-profit health insurance companies and present the New York Health Act as the alternative at a news conference in front of Hochul's office.</div><div>A Hochul impersonation will illustrate the difference between putting people first and going along with corporate exploitation of the health system to rake in profits. &nbsp;</div><p>DSA run club members will pour into the Midtown event in the spirit of all New Yorkers running toward healthy lives, a humane health system, and a socialist future.</p><div>Interested media will find out what else socialists want for New York now while asking Governor Hochul, Which side are you on?<br><br></div><div><br></div></div><span></span>",
      "browser_url": "https://actionnetwork.org/events/nyha-presser-at-hochul",
      "signup_url": "https://actionnetwork.org/events/nyha-presser-at-hochul",
      "location": "919 3rd Ave (entry on E 55th btwn 2nd & 3rd)",
      "borough": "New York"
    },
